					"content": "Could you go over the plan with me again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150201103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150201103,
					"content": "Oh, sure. So, I'm gonna send the explosives over to the spout on the other side in a hot air balloon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150201104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bold Investigator"
				},
				{
					"id": 150201104,
					"content": "All you have to do is <color=#00E1FFFF>hit the balloon at the right moment, so the bomb falls right on top of the spout.</color> Simple!",
